### =========================
### BODY METRIC API TEST
### Base URL: {{baseUrl}}
### Required token: Bearer {{accessToken}}
### =========================


### 1. Create my body metric
POST {{baseUrl}}/body-metrics
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "heightCm": 175.0,
  "weightKg": 70.5,
  "bodyFatPercent": 18.5,
  "muscleMassKg": 32.0,
  "waistCm": 78.0,
  "chestCm": 95.0,
  "hipCm": 90.0,
  "note": "Initial body metric record"
}


### 2. Get my latest body metric
GET {{baseUrl}}/body-metrics/latest
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}


### 3. Get my body metric history
GET {{baseUrl}}/body-metrics/me
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}


### 4. Get my body metric history with paging
GET {{baseUrl}}/body-metrics/me?page=0&size=10
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}


### 5. Get body metric by id
GET {{baseUrl}}/body-metrics/1
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}


### 6. Update body metric
PUT {{baseUrl}}/body-metrics/1
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "heightCm": 175.0,
  "weightKg": 69.8,
  "bodyFatPercent": 17.9,
  "muscleMassKg": 32.4,
  "waistCm": 77.0,
  "chestCm": 95.5,
  "hipCm": 89.5,
  "note": "Updated after two weeks"
}


### 7. Delete body metric
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/body-metrics/1
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}


### 8. Test validation failed - missing height and weight
POST {{baseUrl}}/body-metrics
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "heightCm": null,
  "weightKg": null,
  "bodyFatPercent": -1,
  "muscleMassKg": -5,
  "waistCm": 0,
  "note": "Invalid body metric"
}


### 9. Test unauthorized - no token
GET {{baseUrl}}/body-metrics/latest
Accept: application/json